    seed_stage2_optional_dot_question_collection_semantics_divergence_2026-11-22, 0, "On collection optionals, not xs.? means absent-or-empty rather than xs.is_none(), and the Rust seed and Stage 2 disagree on .? semantics. Lint rule NDQ001 (not_dot_question) is implemented in src/compiler/35.semantics/lint/not_dot_question.spl and registered in static_lint_rule_table(); the seed vs Stage 2 .? semantic divergence itself remains open."

